# Scheduled jobs (jobs.scheduled.turbineh): shared secret of GET|POST /api/cron/run (header x-cron-secret or
# Authorization: Bearer — what Vercel Cron sends). At least 32 random characters; without it the route answers 503.
# Call the route every 5–15 minutes from any scheduler; each scheduled time of each job runs once.
CRON_SECRET=
